medicineTest('operator disable retains approvals and requires explicit reenrollment manifest',function(){[$f,$ids]=medicinePilotActiveFixture();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e,$i,$p]=$f;$id=$ids[0];$enrolled=$p->configuration['pilot_activation']['enrollments'][0];$a->actorId=8;$out=$s->disablePilot('chemical',$id,['expected_revision'=>$enrolled['revision'],'expected_enrollment_event_id'=>$enrolled['enrollment_event_id'],'rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC pause']);medicineCheck($out['active']===false);$e->requireCurrent('chemical',$id);$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->internalPilot('chemical',$id),409);$a->actorId=8;$new=$s->enrollPilot('chemical',$id,medicinePilotInput($f,$id,$out['event_id']));$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->internalPilot('chemical',$id),409);$p->configuration['pilot_activation']['enrollments'][0]['enrollment_event_id']=$new['event_id'];$s->internalPilot('chemical',$id);medicineCheck(count(array_filter($r->events('chemical',$id),fn($e)=>$e['action']==='pilot_disable'))===1);});
medicineTest('disable remains authorized while pilot paused and evidence withdrawn',function(){[$f,$ids]=medicinePilotActiveFixture();$entry=$f[6]->configuration['pilot_activation']['enrollments'][0];$f[6]->configuration['pilot_enabled']=false;$f[2]->actorId=1;$in=['expected_revision'=>$entry['revision'],'expected_enrollment_event_id'=>$entry['enrollment_event_id'],'rationale'=>'Paused'];medicineReject(fn()=>$f[1]->disablePilot('chemical',$ids[0],$in),403);$f[2]->actorId=8;$out=$f[1]->disablePilot('chemical',$ids[0],$in);medicineCheck($out['active']===false);});
medicineTest('invalidation requires reassessment submission review then fresh operator enrollment',function(){[$f,$ids]=medicinePilotActiveFixture();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e,$i,$p]=$f;$id=$ids[0];$old=$p->configuration['pilot_activation']['enrollments'][0];$a->actorId=4;$s->invalidate('chemical',$id,['expected_revision'=>$old['revision'],'state'=>'invalidated','rationale'=>'Synthetic invalidation']);$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->internalPilot('chemical',$id),409);$a->actorId=2;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->verify('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'Old approval','evidence'=>medicineSyntheticEvidence()])),403);medicineV1Verify($f,$id);$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->internalPilot('chemical',$id),409);$a->actorId=8;$new=$s->enrollPilot('chemical',$id,medicinePilotInput($f,$id,$old['enrollment_event_id']));medicineCheck((string)$new['approval_event_id']!==$old['approval_event_id']);medicineCheck(in_array('invalidated',array_column($r->events('chemical',$id),'new_state'),true));});
medicineTest('withdrawal cannot be overwritten by enrollment or reassessment',function(){[$f,$id]=medicinePilotApproved();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e]=$f;$a->actorId=4;$s->invalidate('chemical',$id,['expected_revision'=>$r->target('chemical',$id)['metadata_revision'],'state'=>'withdrawn','rationale'=>'Synthetic withdrawal']);$a->actorId=8;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->enrollPilot('chemical',$id,['expected_revision'=>$r->target('chemical',$id)['metadata_revision'],'expected_snapshot_hash'=>str_repeat('0',64),'expected_enrollment_event_id'=>'0','rationale'=>'Bypass']),409);$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->assessChemical($id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['state'=>'candidate','rationale'=>'Bypass'])),409);});
medicineTest('rejection is retained and requires fresh reconsideration',function(){ $f=medicineV1Fixture();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e,$i,$p]=$f;$id=$i->registerChemicalReference(['substance_id'=>'2'])['chemical_ref_id'];$s->assessChemical($id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['state'=>'candidate','rationale'=>'Candidate']));$ev=medicineV1Appraise($p,$e,'chemical',$id);$s->submit('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'Submit','evidence'=>$ev]));$a->actorId=2;$rejected=$s->reject('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'Synthetic rejection']));$event=$r->event($rejected['event_id']);$a->actorId=8;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->enrollPilot('chemical',$id,medicinePilotInput($f,$id)),409);medicineV1Verify($f,$id);medicineCheck($r->event($rejected['event_id'])===$event&&$r->latest('chemical',$id)['action']==='verify');});
medicineTest('approved composition uses same enrollment and minimal internal path',function(){[$f,$ids]=medicinePilotActiveFixture();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e,$i,$p]=$f;$a->actorId=1;$id=$i->createMedicine(['ingredients'=>[['substance_id'=>'2']],'display_name'=>'SYNTHETIC ONLY composition'])['medicine_identity_id'];$a->actorId=4;$ev=medicineV1Appraise($p,$e,'composition',$id);$s->submit('composition',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'composition',$id,['rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC submission','evidence'=>$ev]));$a->actorId=2;$s->verify('composition',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'composition',$id,['rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC independent review','evidence'=>$ev]));$a->actorId=8;$new=$s->enrollPilot('composition',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'composition',$id,['expected_enrollment_event_id'=>'0','rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC operator']));$p->configuration['pilot_activation']['enrollments'][0]=['scope'=>'composition','target_id'=>$id,'revision'=>(string)$new['revision'],'approval_event_id'=>(string)$new['approval_event_id'],'enrollment_event_id'=>$new['event_id']];$a->actorId=1;$out=$s->internalPilot('composition',$id);medicineCheck($out['display_name']==='SYNTHETIC ONLY composition'&&$out['published']===false);$a->actorId=4;$out=$s->internalPilot('composition',$id);medicineCheck($out['scope']==='composition');});
medicineTest('qualified contributor cannot approve own submitted revision even with admin authority',function(){ $f=medicineV1Fixture();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e,$i,$p]=$f;$id=$i->registerChemicalReference(['substance_id'=>'2'])['chemical_ref_id'];$s->assessChemical($id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['state'=>'candidate','rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC assessment']));$ev=medicineV1Appraise($p,$e,'chemical',$id);$s->submit('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC submission','evidence'=>$ev]));$a->actorId=8;foreach(['reviewer','administrator'] as $cap){$input=['user_id'=>1,'capability'=>$cap,'scope'=>'catalog','expires_at'=>'2030-01-01 00:00:00.000001','rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC grant'];if($cap==='reviewer'){$input+=['qualification_reference'=>medicineV1Credential(),'qualification_scope'=>'catalog'];}$s->grantAuthority($input);}$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->verify('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'Self approval','evidence'=>$ev])),403);$a->actorId=2;$out=$s->verify('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'Independent','evidence'=>$ev]));medicineCheck($out['published']===false);});
medicineTest('revision changed after reviewer captured token rejects stale approval',function(){ $f=medicineV1Fixture();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e,$i,$p]=$f;$id=$i->registerChemicalReference(['substance_id'=>'2'])['chemical_ref_id'];$s->assessChemical($id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['state'=>'candidate','rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC assessment']));$ev=medicineV1Appraise($p,$e,'chemical',$id);$s->submit('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC submission','evidence'=>$ev]));$stale=medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'SYNTHETIC stale','evidence'=>$ev]);$s->assessChemical($id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['state'=>'candidate','rationale'=>'Changed revision']));$a->actorId=2;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->verify('chemical',$id,$stale),409);medicineReject(fn()=>$s->verify('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'No fresh submit','evidence'=>$ev])),403);});
medicineTest('unauthorized evidence mutation and client permission escalation denied',function(){[$f,$id]=medicinePilotApproved();[$r,$s,$a,$auth,$e]=$f;$before=$r->eventRows;$a->actorId=6;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->submit('chemical',$id,medicineGovernanceInput($r,$e,'chemical',$id,['rationale'=>'Unauthorized','evidence'=>medicineSyntheticEvidence()])),403);$a->actorId=1;medicineReject(fn()=>$s->enrollPilot('chemical',$id,['role'=>'deployment','actor_id'=>8]),403);medicineCheck($before===$r->eventRows);});
